      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T18:23:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ping. Any guidance on how you want to proceed on the SIMD patch? Alternatively, if you are unwilling to accept patches for 8.1, I could try other workarounds. Either way, let me know.",
      "revId": "165450220ef432c4b40bba918b124b995f7ff0b3",
