      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T21:25:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think `(__clang__ || (__GNUC__ \u003e\u003d 3 \u0026\u0026 __GNUC_MINOR__ \u003e 2))` is the incantation. Though its not Skia specific.",
      "parentUuid": "6ffb1d3d_bb268eb9",
