      "writtenOn": "2025-01-24T15:17:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "aside for Ben: given the prior comment about `vrndns_f32` \"matching\" `vcvtq_u32_f32`, I\u0027d think we would *not* want to be adding 0.5 here, since both functions are already supposedly doing round-to-nearest even.",
