      "writtenOn": "2025-01-27T17:08:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "uint32x4_t vcvtq_u32_f32(float32x4_t a): Floating-point Convert to Unsigned fixed-point, rounding toward Zero (vector).\n\nRound to even is `vcvtnq_u32_f32`? Do we want to use that for consistency, or is there some other issue with using it?",
